        "text": "Cleo Abram (15M followers across all platforms) just released a new video about @neuralink. She visited the company's Austin HQ.\n\n\"This is Neuralink’s Next-Gen R1 surgical robot. Its main job is to put a computer chip into people's brains, and this is the first time they're unveiling it.\"\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vna0hkq7U1g",
