        "text": "James Talarico wants to end the filibuster, is open to packing the Supreme Court, and backs a pathway to citizenship for millions. In his own words:\n\n“We should abolish the filibuster in the U.S. Senate…”\n\n“I’m open to a discussion about expanding the number of justices.”\n\n“I think we should have a pathway for those folks to join us as full citizens.”\n\nTalarico now calls himself a “border security Democrat.”\n\nBut while millions crossed the border under Biden, he voted against border security eight times. \n\nThen in 2025, he voted no again.\n\nEnd the filibuster. Pack the Supreme Court. Open the border. Citizenship for millions.\n\nThat’s what James Talarico will vote for in Washington.\n\nElon Musk is right. Election Day is Nov. 3. Go vote, Texas!",
        "url": "https://x.com/KanekoaTheGreat/status/2116222104907764086",
